{"id":"bc852fdef9f33c3f","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbpersistencyreduction.md","title":"强持久固定后的无损最优化","display":"thm-pbpersistencyreduction — 强持久固定后的无损最优化","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbpersistencyreduction","aliases":["27-thm-pbpersistencyreduction"],"display":"thm-pbpersistencyreduction — 强持久固定后的无损最优化","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbpersistency]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.1","source_printed_pages":"595","source_pdf_pages":"619","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbpersistencyreduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbpersistencyreduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbpersistencyreduction — 强持久固定后的无损最优化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b041170088bcba26\" href=\"?note=b041170088bcba26\" title=\"27-df-pbpersistency\">27-df-pbpersistency</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"595"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"619"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq[n]\">\\(I\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I\\)</span>，且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}(f,I,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}(f,I,a)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b041170088bcba26\" href=\"?note=b041170088bcba26\" title=\"27-df-pbpersistency\">27-df-pbpersistency</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:x|_I=a\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:x|_I=a\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{x\\in F}f(x)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{x\\in F}f(x)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\in F:\\forall y\\in F\\;f(y)\\le f(x)\\}=\n\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(y)\\le f(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{x\\in F:\\forall y\\in F\\;f(y)\\le f(x)\\}=\n\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(y)\\le f(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限非空立方体存在全局最优点；强持久前提使全部这些点都在F，故限制后最大值相同。F内任何最优点达到该全局值，另一方向显然。本条只需要给出的StrongPersistent假设，不以未审证明的roof存在定理为前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbpersistency","status":"resolved","id":"b041170088bcba26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpersistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbpersistency","status":"resolved","id":"b041170088bcba26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$，$I\\subseteq[n]$，$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I$，且$\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}(f,I,a)$，见 [[27-df-pbpersistency]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}(f,I,a)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:x|_I=a\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\max_{x\\in F}f(x)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{x\\in F:\\forall y\\in F\\;f(y)\\le f(x)\\}=\n\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(y)\\le f(x)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbpersistencyreduction|thm-pbpersistencyreduction — 强持久固定后的无损最优化]]"}],"outgoing":["b041170088bcba26"]}